---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Legal & Professional Information";
const description = "Professional registration, UAE real estate practices, and guidance on using information published on ivandubai.xyz.";
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description} showHeader={false}>
    <article class="mb-16 sm:mb-24">
        <header class="mb-8">
            <h1 class="text-3xl leading-tight font-serif font-medium sm:text-5xl sm:leading-tight">{title}</h1>
        </header>
        <div class="max-w-none prose sm:prose-lg">
            <p>This page provides information about my professional registration, my approach to real estate in the UAE, and how information published on ivandubai.xyz should be used.</p>

            <p>I am Ivan Tyrtyshnyi, a real estate broker based in Dubai. The website draws on my professional practice, market research and experience working with clients.</p>

            <h2>Professional Registration</h2>

            <p><strong>Ivan Tyrtyshnyi</strong><br />Real Estate Broker, Dubai, UAE</p>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>Broker Registration Number (BRN):</strong> 48861</li>
                <li><strong>Brokerage:</strong> Knightsbridge Properties</li>
                <li><strong>Office Registration Number (ORN):</strong> 22004</li>
                <li><strong>Advertiser Permit (UAE Media Council):</strong> No. 5798161</li>
            </ul>

            <p>Broker and brokerage registration details can be verified through the <a href="https://dubailand.gov.ae/en/eservices/validate-real-estate-licenses-and-permits/">Dubai Land Department (DLD)</a>.</p>

            <p>My professional profile is available on <a href="https://www.propertyfinder.ae/en/agent/ivan-tyrtyshnyi-171170">Property Finder</a>. You can also <a href="https://maps.google.com/?cid=5197998022612562366">read client reviews of my work on Google</a>.</p>

            <h2>Property Information</h2>

            <p>This website publishes UAE property market analysis, residential project information, professional observations and accounts of work with clients.</p>

            <p>Property prices, availability, specifications, payment terms and handover dates reflect the information available at the time of publication and may change.</p>

            <p>Before buying or leasing a property, prospective clients should confirm the current terms, review the relevant property documents, verify ownership or developer details, and establish any applicable charges or restrictions.</p>

            <p>Property advertising in Dubai is subject to DLD requirements. Where a Trakheesi permit is required, its details are provided in the relevant advertisement.</p>

            <p>The information on this website is provided for general information. The terms of an individual transaction are governed by the documents agreed between the parties and applicable UAE law.</p>

            <h2>Market Analysis &amp; Investment Decisions</h2>

            <p>My publications bring together market data, professional experience and my own assessment of developments in the property sector.</p>

            <p>When evaluating real estate, I consider asking prices, potential returns, liquidity, demand, location, ongoing ownership costs, the outlook for the surrounding area and the risks of each investment scenario.</p>

            <p>Forecasts describe possible outcomes. Actual results depend on market conditions, the property itself and the terms of the transaction.</p>

            <p><strong>The information and opinions provided are for general guidance and do not constitute financial or investment advice.</strong></p>

            <p>Past rental yields or capital appreciation do not guarantee future performance. Legal, tax and financial matters should be reviewed with appropriately qualified advisers before entering into binding commitments.</p>

            <h2>Working With Clients</h2>

            <p>A property search begins with understanding the client's objectives, intended use of the property, budget, timeframe and individual requirements.</p>

            <p>Projects and market commentary on this website are intended to help visitors explore their options. They do not constitute binding offers to sell or lease property.</p>

            <p>Availability, final pricing, brokerage fees, additional charges and transaction procedures are confirmed separately.</p>

            <p>Submitting an enquiry through this website does not create an obligation to enter into a transaction.</p>

            <h2>Artificial Intelligence: Professional Practice &amp; Writing</h2>

            <p>Artificial intelligence is part of both my professional work and my wider research interests.</p>

            <p>In real estate, I use AI tools to research markets, organise information, compare properties and assess alternatives. These tools help process large amounts of information, identify patterns and examine different scenarios.</p>

            <p>My interest in AI also extends to the relationship between people and intelligent systems.</p>

            <p>I am the author of the literary trilogy <strong>Pulse Between the Lines</strong>. The work grew out of my personal experience of interacting with artificial intelligence and explores dialogue, memory, perception and questions of presence at the intersection of human experience and machine response.</p>

            <p><strong><a href="https://play.google.com/store/books/details?id=OohSEQAAQBAJ">Read the English edition of Pulse Between the Lines on Google Play Books</a></strong></p>

            <p>This creative and research experience informs how I approach technology, including its capabilities, limitations and the ways people interact with it.</p>

            <p>In my professional work, AI-assisted analysis requires verification against primary sources. I remain responsible for my published materials and professional recommendations. The client makes the final decision to buy, sell or lease a property.</p>

            <h2>Personal Information &amp; Third-Party Services</h2>

            <p>Visitors who use the contact form provide their name, email address and message. This information is used to review and respond to their enquiry.</p>

            <p>The website uses third-party services for communication and site operations:</p>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>Formspree</strong> processes and forwards messages submitted through the contact form.</li>
                <li><strong>Yandex.Metrika</strong> provides website traffic and interaction analytics, including Webvisor session-recording functionality.</li>
                <li><strong>Metricool</strong> measures website visits and pages viewed, with approximate location derived from the visitor's IP address. Its website visit tracker does not use cookies. Data collection begins when the tracker is installed.</li>
                <li><strong>WhatsApp and Telegram</strong> are alternative communication channels available at the visitor's discretion.</li>
            </ul>

            <p>Information shared through these services may be processed by the respective providers, including outside the UAE. Their own terms and privacy policies apply to that processing.</p>

            <p>Questions about personal information, including requests for correction or deletion, can be submitted through the <a href="/en/contact/">website contact form</a>.</p>

            <p>This section is a brief description of data processing practices and does not replace a separate privacy policy.</p>

            <h2>Contact</h2>

            <p><strong>ivandubai.xyz</strong> is operated by Ivan Tyrtyshnyi, Dubai, United Arab Emirates.</p>

            <p>For enquiries about professional services, published materials or potential cooperation, please use the <a href="/en/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>

            <hr />

            <p><strong>Last updated: 16 November 2026.</strong></p>
        </div>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>
